      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Just uncovering Tin's letter of Jan. 13 I determined without further delay write you at least a few lines. - Better waiting for time to write a letter. First I've been wanting, it seem to ne two months, to thank for that second delivery; from the \"Grove\" - if anything an improvement on the Ist. The Brethren surely appreciated them. Then Many thanks for your mission-activity - and Win's too - in the many enrollments, including the old simmer who has given us here so much conscience trouble, Fr. Solenus - and the other features of your monthly donations - so often (as must seen to you) unappreciated. I do hope you are both enjoying your vacation in your sway S . Western sojourn .... Praised be Jesus and Mary.",
      "per_polygon": "Just uncovering Tin's letter of Jan. 13 I determined without further delay write you at least a few lines. - Better waiting for time to write a letter. First I've been wanting, it seem to ne two months, to thank for that second deliver; from the \"Grove\" - if anything an improvement on the Ist. The Brethren surely appreciated then. Then Many thanks for your mission-activity - and Win's too - in the many enrollments, including the old simmer who has given us here so much conscience trouble, Fr. Solenus - and the other features of your monthly donations - so often (as must seen to you) unappreciated. I do hope you are both enjoying your vacation in your sumy S.Western sojoum Praised be Jesus and Mary.",
